			<item> <title>The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping, 2026 - ★★★</title> <link>https://letterboxd.com/masonbair/film/the-hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping/</link> <guid isPermaLink="false">letterboxd-review-1600574226</guid> <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:19:21 +1300</pubDate> <letterboxd:watchedDate>2026-11-23</letterboxd:watchedDate> <letterboxd:rewatch>No</letterboxd:rewatch> <letterboxd:filmTitle>The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping</letterboxd:filmTitle> <letterboxd:filmYear>2026</letterboxd:filmYear> <letterboxd:memberRating>3.0</letterboxd:memberRating> <letterboxd:memberLike>No</letterboxd:memberLike> <tmdb:movieId>1300968</tmdb:movieId> <description><![CDATA[ <p><img src="https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/film-poster/1/1/8/2/6/9/2/1182692-the-hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping-0-600-0-900-crop.jpg?v=91001efc76"/></p> <p>The story and feels of this movie were great!</p><p>I just wished some scenes were more realistic. Some of the ways they ha died parts if the movie felt forced and lots of unrealistic situations where someone should have died or been caught.</p><p>But a movie I could enjoy in theaters without looking at my watch!</p> ]]></description> <dc:creator>masonbair</dc:creator> </item>
